<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS1" title="In D.2 Proof of ‣ Appendix D Proof of ‣ Non-Asymptotic Analysis Of Data Augmentation For Precision Matrix Estimation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.1 </span>Concentration of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Phi_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Φ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Phi_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS2" title="In D.2 Proof of ‣ Appendix D Proof of ‣ Non-Asymptotic Analysis Of Data Augmentation For Precision Matrix Estimation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.2 </span>An upper bound on the asymptotic bias of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{\mathcal{E}}_{\mathrm{Aug}}(\lambda)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>Aug</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{\mathcal{E}}_{\mathrm{Aug}}(\lambda)</annotation></semantics></math></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A4.SS2.SSS3" title="In D.2 Proof of ‣ Appendix D Proof of ‣ Non-Asymptotic Analysis Of Data Augmentation For Precision Matrix Estimation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D.2.3 </span>Conclusion on the proof of <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
