<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Non-Asymptotic Analysis Of Data Augmentation For Precision Matrix Estimation</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Lucas Morisset
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Qube Research and Technologies
